==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Lycanroc}} in its {{form|Lycanroc|Midday Form}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Champion's Path|Lycanroc|30}} from the {{TCG|Champion's Path}} expansion.
*{{m|Crunch}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Lycanroc}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

